<title>UK: Survey finds best job hopes for seven years - paper.</title>
<headline>Survey finds best job hopes for seven years - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Post-election job prospects in the UK are the best for seven years, according to a survey by Manpower recruitment group published by the Daily Telegraph on Monday.</p>
<p>The survey, covering 2,000 companies, showed confidence growing across the industrial sectors, the paper said.</p>
<p>For the second quarter of 1997, 26 percent of companies were forecasting an increase in recruitment compared with 12 percent predicting a fall.</p>
<p>- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
